nife capability shell. naming a resource in a command IS granting it.
commands: help, echo <text>, caps [command], time <command>, xargs <command>,
          cd, pwd, ls, mkdir, touch, apropos <word>, rm, wc, mdr, <prog> [--mem N] [arg]
          and the operators  >  >>  <  |
          'quote a whole word'   and   ;  &&  ||   with  echo $?  for the status
$ echo hi
hi
$ 
